{
  "dom_id": "step-e4668",
  "name": "Example: Applying the Power of Product Rule",
  "problem": "Express $(3\\times 2)^2$ as the product of two powers.",
  "worked_solution": "To raise the product of two numbers to the power of $2,$ we can raise each number to the power of $2,$ and then multiply:\n\n$$\n(3\\times 2)^2=3^2\\times 2^2\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
